("h2","2.8 Nouns Used as Other Parts of Speech; Compound Nouns"),
("p","**Compound nouns** join two words: *toothbrush, mother-in-law, post office, bus stop, schoolbag, rainbow*. Some are written solid, some hyphenated, some as two words; check a dictionary. Nouns can act as adjectives: *a **stone** wall, a **school** bus, a **gold** ring*."),
