("note","IMPORTANT","Common mistakes: (1) 'The scenery of hills are beautiful' → *is*. (2) 'He gave me many advices' → *a lot of advice*. (3) 'Two dozens eggs' → *two dozen eggs* (no -s after a number when the noun follows); but *dozens of eggs*. (4) 'Hundreds / thousands / millions *of*' when no number precedes: *three hundred*, *hundreds of*."),
